            <Text style={{ fontSize: 64, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.2, letterSpacing: 1 }}>
                832 县域产业证据管理数据库
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#4A5568', fontFamily: 'Times New Roman', letterSpacing: 0.5 }}>
                A Multi-Source Evidence Database for County-Level Industry Research
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ width: 120, height: 3, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 6 }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
                把散在网页里的公开报道，做成一条条能追回原文、能被人审核的产业案例
            </Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 56 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>汇报人</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230' }}>＿＿＿＿＿＿</Text>
